# wallhack

Layer 3 tunneling over QUIC and WebSockets, built for network pivoting in penetration testing scenarios.

By establishing a full dual-stack TUN interface on the [entry node](/concepts), traffic is routed transparently (TCP, UDP, ICMP, over both IPv4 and IPv6) without the need for proxy chains or SOCKS configuration.

QUIC can egress over any open outbound UDP port; WebSockets can traverse HTTP proxies and deep packet inspection, appearing as HTTPS traffic on port 443.

